+
+Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`, implementing JSON Patch (RFC 6902) with the
+operations add, remove, replace, move, copy and test. It returns a new document (input and patch are
+not mutated or aliased) and throws on an invalid patch or a failing operation. Tests in `src/index.test.ts`.
